    {
      "id": "p-halfhour",
      "text": "半小时处理链（phone/tablet_facts 输入）\n• 手机/平板 JSONL → facts → 合并 → 标签\n• → 语义时间线 → 指标 → AI 报告\n• 详见 03-Pi内部流程.canvas",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2260,
      "y": 460,
      "width": 420,
      "height": 290,
      "color": "4"
    },
    {
      "id": "a-files",
      "text": "Documents/PhoneUsage/\n• YYYY-MM-DD-{foreground,screen,heartbeat}.jsonl\n• 心跳每 ~15 分钟一条；启动即写一条​\t\n• ⚠️ 旧版无日期文件是否已清理（待确认）",
